stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> planned: create session
    planned --> live: manager clicks Start
    live --> voting: manager clicks Move to voting
    voting --> live: manager clicks Back to live
    voting --> closed: manager clicks Close
    live --> closed: manager clicks Close (skip voting)
    closed --> [*]

    note right of live
        Item entry allowed.
        Votes hidden.
    end note

    note right of voting
        Item entry locked.
        Each member: 3 votes / column.
    end note

    note right of closed
        Read-only.
        Export + ADO push available.
    end note
